{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "176f4571-504c-8ed0-b6db-4f42562a24c8",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T10:38:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:33:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Denise, my name's Vincent Grasso. I'm calling about flooding on my street. Five Chapel Street, up in the Historic Hill area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:33:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Grasso. What's going on at Chapel Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:33:30-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water's over the curb and straight across the sidewalk. It's been like that since last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. It's Wednesday now. Wednesday! And it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still standing three days later. Is it coming up from a drain, or is it just pooling in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:34:02-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's pooling around the drain, the drain's just not taking anything. And this morning a delivery truck tried to come through and got stuck. Wicked embarrassing for him, honestly, he had to get towed out. Water was up to about the hubcaps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:34:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps. Okay, that's deep. Was anybody hurt, or the truck in any danger?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody's hurt. Driver was fine, just soaked and mad. But I mean, totally predictable. I've watched people slow down and creep through it all week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And I'm not even home right now, I'm standing on a platform in another town waiting on a train connection, so my neighbor's the one who texted me about the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. That's why the line's a little windy. Let me get this down. Five Chapel Street, and the water's at the curb in front of your place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:35:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, right in front, and it runs down toward the corner a bit. [line breaks up] ...the drain is right at the low spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:35:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me there. The drain's at the low spot, in front of five?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:35:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right in front, at the low spot. It's been clogged, I'd bet on it. Leaves, sand, whatever the storm pushed in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's very possible. After a storm like that, the drains pack up with debris. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check and clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because honestly, it's frustrating. It's been three days, and nobody's come by. I figured somebody would at least put out a cone or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:36:41-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Crews have had a lot of calls since the storm, so there's a backlog. But I'll mark this one as water across the sidewalk with a vehicle stuck, so it gets a look sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do the crews work on weekends? Because if it's not getting done till after Saturday, I'm gonna be looking at the same lake."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They can, when it's needed, but I can't promise you a day. Weekday crews are the ones who take these requests, so I'd expect someone sooner than the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:37:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so like today or tomorrow, maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a firm day, but I'm flagging it as urgent. Is there a number where the crew can reach you if they need to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:38:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-two. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And if the water goes down on its own it'll just come right back next time it rains, you know? That's what bugs me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:38:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that it's a recurring low spot too, so the crew looks at the drain itself and not only the surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:38:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally. Okay. That'd be great, thanks. My train's pulling in, so I gotta go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:38:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Safe travels, Mr. Grasso. Somebody will be out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Denise. Bye."
    }
  ],
